@name     freq_feedback
@alias    FB
@group    osc
@c_name   skode_clause_freq_feedback
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  oscillator frequency feedback amount
@doc
Sets oscillator frequency self-feedback amount.
Usage: FB amount (or freq_feedback amount)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    return freq_feedback_set(voice, args[0]);
@end
